<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>From the next arc on, the difficulty of the story rises sharply, the characters increase in number as well, and a more eerie and frightening world awaits you.<PG>
Are you prepared? To think that avoiding the Megasawa City case would lead to something like that.<PG>
However, I have a feeling that Ryoji Kogori said something a little curious...<PG>
Ah, no, it is nothing. It is probably just my imagination.<PG>
Then, I will guide you. It is the fourth arc, 'the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しがつ">Shigatsu</STYLE> Arc [Death Month].'<PG>
